  dbops-query <command> [args]
  dbops-query "SELECT ..."        # uses configured default target
  echo "SELECT ..." | dbops-query # uses configured default target

Commands:
  auth             capture dbops login cookie
  query-on         run readonly SQL on explicit instance/database
  instances        list readable instances
  resources        list databases, tables, or schemas
  querylog         list recent query logs
  queryloginfo     show one query log detail
  favorites        list favorite queries
  favorite-list    alias of favorites
  favorite-find    search favorite queries
  favorite-info    show favorite detail
